From fb885ed4882f1cb12f2bfe4dfc2b0912b4881295 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:44:14 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Lag model: answer long runs of quiet replies without waiting

A write or a status the GBA has answered with no receive flag eight times running is answered the
same. Replayed against five local two-player sessions this takes the commands that wait from about
10,000 to about 1,500 in a hundred thousand. GBLinkJoyQuiet=false turns it off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01764cASb9aVVk2m6JupRMj5
